          "jcr:created": "Mon Jan 29 2024 17:00:21 GMT+0000",
          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\">Iconix HA+</span></p>\n<p>Images show bone growing adjacent to the implant with some integration into the anchor.</p>\n",
