          "text": "<p><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\">Comparison at 4 weeks</span></span></p>\n<p>Histology images of an Iconix HA<sup>+</sup> anchor (size 2.3mm) and a leading competitor all-suture anchor (single-loaded) at 4 weeks post-implantation in a large animal ovine study.<sup>13</sup></p>\n<p><span class=\"futura-bold\">A</span> = Anchor</p>\n<p><span class=\"futura-bold\">B&nbsp;</span>= Suture</p>\n<p><span class=\"futura-bold\">Gold circle</span> = Bone formation</p>\n<p><span class=\"futura-bold\">Blue circle</span> = Voids between device and bone</p>\n",
